	<description>RMUC2027 central tower support: bridges the measured 0.36 m gap (world z 1.50 -> 1.86) between the lower and upper diagonal struts of the STEP-derived tower. 2 posts 0.16x0.12x0.52 at (+-0.435, 1.565/1.675) + 2 braces at z=1.62/1.80. See docs/worlds_2027.md §9.7.</description>
